      "options": {
        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "# OWASP Top 10:2025 — A09 Security Logging & Alerting Failures\n\nDrive an attack (credential stuffing, brute force, SSRF, forced browsing) against the **`/safe/a09`** endpoints and these panels light up: auth failures spike, a **brute-force alert** fires, denials and blocked SSRF fetches climb.\n\nRun the **same attack** against the **`/vuln/a09`** endpoints and the charts stay **flat** — no counters move, no alert fires, nothing is logged.\n\n**That gap — the attack that happens but never shows up here — *is* A09.** The vulnerability is not the intrusion; it is that the system never told anyone.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.0.0",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
